---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="How it works" description="How GoServe keeps a 15-minute fresh-food promise: a hyperlocal radius, a live rider mesh, and a decision engine that cooks just in time.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">The engine</span>
      <h1 class="h1">How a 15-minute promise stays honest.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Fast delivery is easy to promise and hard to keep. Three things make it
        real: a tight radius, cooking that starts at the right moment, and a
        rider who is always the nearest free one.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--sage" style="padding-block: var(--gs-space-8)">
    <div class="container flow">
      <ol class="flow-list">
        <li class="reveal">
          <span class="n">1</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="h3">You order</h2>
            <p>A short, fast menu. One tap to pay. No friction between hunger and action.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal">
          <span class="n">2</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="h3">The OS chooses</h2>
            <p>Jev checks the zone, picks the kitchen with the shortest real path, and assigns the nearest free rider.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal">
          <span class="n">3</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="h3">Cooking starts on cue</h2>
            <p>The kitchen begins only when the rider is close. This is what keeps the food hot instead of waiting on a shelf.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal">
          <span class="n">4</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="h3">Live, to your door</h2>
            <p>You watch the rider move on a live map. Your kitchen and our ops team see the same screen.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="reveal">
          <span class="n">5</span>
          <div>
            <h2 class="h3">It arrives hot</h2>
            <p>The promise is not speed for its own sake. It is speed that protects the food.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Why it holds together</span>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom: var(--gs-space-6)">Three ideas, one system.</h2>
      <div class="pillars">
        <article class="card"><h3 class="h3">Hyperlocal radius</h3><p>Short trips mean hot food and riders who know the streets. The promise is small enough to be true.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3 class="h3">One codebase</h3><p>Customer, kitchen, rider, and ops run as one product. Everyone sees the same live truth.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><h3 class="h3">Decisions, not guesses</h3><p>Rider, ETA, next cook, late risk, zone: five answers, recalculated for every order.</p></article>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: var(--gs-space-8)">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/technology">How the engine works</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/pre-register">Pre-register</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .flow-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--gs-space-5);
    counter-reset: none;
  }
  .flow-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr;
    gap: var(--gs-space-5);
    align-items: start;
    background: var(--gs-cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--gs-sage);
    border-radius: var(--gs-radius-l);
    padding: var(--gs-space-5);
  }
  .n {
    font-size: var(--gs-text-2xl);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--gs-deep-green);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .h3 {
    font-size: var(--gs-text-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--gs-space-2);
  }
  .pillars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--gs-space-5);
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .pillars {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .flow-list li {
      grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
